  "2026-08-20T20:10:30.603Z",codex,"A nonzero close receipt is now handled conservatively regardless of code: focused exit-4 simulation leaves the open item and both transaction markers intact for reconciliation."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T20:08:46.596Z",codex,Compensation identity must remain durable until the compensating mutation is confirmed; erasing reconciliation markers before close converts a visible partial failure into an undiscoverable orphan.
